    """
    Kahn's topological sort.

    Parameters
    ----------
    graph : dict[ T , set(T) ]
        Adjacency list where each key is a node and its value is the set of nodes it points to.
    
    Returns
    -------
    list[T]
        A list representing a valid topological ordering. Raises ValueError if a cycle exists.
