| **No external deps** | Pure TypeScript + a tiny spin‑lock helper. |
| **Performance note** | For high‑throughput workloads replace `Lock` with an async mutex (`await lock.acquire()` / `release()`) or use language‑specific primitives (`std::mutex`, `java.util.concurrent.locks.ReentrantLock`). |

