  Below are three **complete** implementations of a tiny “light‑switch” state machine:
  
  * **State diagram**
  
  ```
     +---+      (press)      +---+
     | off| ←───────────────► │ on|
     +---+                    +---+
          ^                |
          |                v
          ▼                ▼
    error          stable transition
