The manager:

| Feature | What it does |
|---------|--------------|
| **Token budget per session** | A configurable limit (`MAX_TOKENS`). When adding a new message the total token count would exceed this limit, the oldest messages are dropped until there is room. |
| **Message ordering** | Keeps an ordered list of *messages* (user → assistant) so that eviction always removes the earliest entry first. |
| **Token counting** | Uses `openai.ChatCompletion.create`’s `response_format.tokens` field to estimate how many tokens a message will cost when it is added. This lets us be realistic about the budget without actually sending anything extra. |
