  | **CLI flags** (`--db-host`, `--http-port`, `--log-level`) | Highest – they replace any value that already exists. |
  | **Environment variables** (`CONFIG_DB_HOST`, `CONFIG_HTTP_PORT`, `CONFIG_LOG_LEVEL`) | Middle – used only if the corresponding config key is missing or explicitly overridden by a flag/env var. |
  | **JSON file** (`config.json`) | Lowest – provides defaults; can be partially overwritten later, but never overrides flags directly unless you add extra logic (not shown). |
  
